  --type: string@type-completer-1 # Type of this creative. This is a required field. Applicable to all creative types. *Note:* FLASH_INPAGE, HTML5_BANNER, and IMAGE are only used for existing creatives. New creatives should use DISPLAY as a replacement for these types.
